{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"g-internal","type":"group","x":960,"y":-760,"width":1310,"height":1800,"color":"6","label":"ragscope-logging / 内部モジュール"},
		{"id":"g-public","type":"group","x":-380,"y":-760,"width":580,"height":2000,"color":"5","label":"ragscope-logging / 公開 Facade"},
		{"id":"g-outside","type":"group","x":-1420,"y":-760,"width":540,"height":1500,"color":"4","label":"Logging の外側（利用側）"},
		{"id":"main","type":"text","text":"## executable `ragscope` / `Main`\n\n**役割**\n- composition root\n- `ExecutionId` を1回生成\n- production `Logger` を初期化\n- main library へ渡す\n\n**利用境界**\n`RAGScope.Logging.Setup`\n","x":-1320,"y":-600,"width":350,"height":320,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"process","type":"text","text":"## main library / 機能処理\n\n**知ってよいもの**\n- `Logger`\n- 機能固有の閉じたイベント\n- `emit`\n\n**知らないもの**\n- UUID / 時刻\n- JSON\n- stderr\n- `Core` / `Runtime`\n","x":-1320,"y":-190,"width":350,"height":350,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"featurelogging","type":"text","text":"## main library / 機能ログ定義\n\n機能固有イベントを\n`ToEventSpec` で共通 `EventSpec` へ写像。\n\n低水準の EventSpec API を利用する境界。\n","x":-1320,"y":240,"width":350,"height":160,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"tests","type":"text","text":"## test-suite `ragscope-test`\n\n- 通常APIの `emit`\n- テスト専用 Facade\n- 固定ID / 固定Clock\n- Memory / Failure Sink\n\n内部moduleを直接利用しない。\n","x":-1320,"y":455,"width":350,"height":220,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"logging","type":"text","text":"# `RAGScope.Logging`\n\n**通常利用 Facade**\n\n公開:\n- `Logger`\n- `LoggingFailure`\n- `emit`\n\nほぼ `Runtime` の安全な再公開。\n","x":-280,"y":-620,"width":400,"height":310,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"eventspec","type":"text","text":"# `RAGScope.Logging.EventSpec`\n\n**イベント定義 Facade**\n\n公開:\n- `ToEventSpec`\n- `EventSpec`\n- `Payload`\n- `LogError`\n- `debug/info/warn/failedEventSpec`\n- 各種 smart constructor\n\n`Core` のイベント定義APIだけを選んで公開。\n","x":-280,"y":-235,"width":400,"height":390,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"setup","type":"text","text":"# `RAGScope.Logging.Setup`\n\n**production 初期化 Facade**\n\n公開:\n- `LoggingConfig`\n- `LogLevel`\n- `ExecutionId`\n- `newExecutionId`\n- `newExecutionLogger`\n- `newServiceLogger`\n\n本番用の依存を具体的に選び、\n`mkLogger` へ注入する。\n","x":-280,"y":260,"width":400,"height":390,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"testing","type":"text","text":"# `RAGScope.Logging.Testing`\n\n**test 専用 Facade**\n\n提供:\n- fixed EventId / ExecutionId / Clock\n- Memory Sink\n- Failure Sink\n- test event\n- test Logger constructor\n\nテストから内部表現へ直接依存させない。\n","x":-280,"y":743,"width":400,"height":375,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"core","type":"text","text":"# `RAGScope.Logging.Core`\n\n**純粋な共通型・不変条件**\n\n- `SchemaVersion`\n- `ExecutionId`, `EventId`, `Timestamp`\n- `Component`, `EventContext`\n- `LogLevel`\n- `EventSpec`\n- `LogEvent`\n- `Payload`, `LogError`\n- `ToEventSpec`\n\nLogging基盤の最下層。\nI/Oを持たない。\n","x":1170,"y":-700,"width":360,"height":420,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"backend","type":"text","text":"# `RAGScope.Logging.Backend.AesonStderr`\n\n**production Sink**\n\n- `encodeLogEvent`\n  - `LogEvent -> Aeson.Value`\n  - JSON rootへ平坦化\n- `aesonStderrSink`\n  - 1 event = 1 line\n  - stderrへ出力\n  - `IOException` → `LoggingSinkFailure`\n","x":1070,"y":620,"width":560,"height":310,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"runtime","type":"text","text":"# `RAGScope.Logging.Runtime`\n\n**Logger の実行機構**\n\n保持する依存:\n- `EventIdSource :: IO EventId`\n- `Clock :: IO Timestamp`\n- `Sink :: LogEvent -> IO ...`\n\n主な処理 `emit`:\n1. `ToEventSpec`\n2. level filter\n3. EventId取得\n4. Timestamp取得\n5. `LogEvent` 完成\n6. Sinkへ渡す\n","x":1750,"y":-70,"width":395,"height":450,"color":"6"}
	],
	"edges":[
